        slug: "configuration-reference",
        title: "Configuration Reference",
        category: "configuration",
        content: "This reference covers all configuration options available in Blackbox Sentinel.\n\n## System Configuration\n\n### Hostname and Identity\n\nsystem config --hostname sentinel-01\nsystem config --location Substation Alpha\nsystem config --contact ops@example.com\n\n### Time and NTP\n\nntp config --server 10.0.0.1 --enable\nntp config --timezone Europe/Amsterdam\n\n### Logging\n\nlogging config --level info\nlogging config --syslog 10.0.0.2:514\nlogging config --retention 90d\n\n## Network Configuration\n\n### Interface Management\n\nnetwork interface --name eth0 --mode management\nnetwork interface --name eth1 --mode monitor\nnetwork interface --name eth2 --mode monitor\n\n### VLAN Configuration\n\nnetwork vlan --interface eth0 --id 100 --name management\nnetwork vlan --interface eth1 --id 200 --name monitoring\n\n### Static Routes\n\nnetwork route --destination 10.0.0.0/8 --gateway 10.0.1.1\n\n## Protocol Dissector Configuration\n\n### Enable/Disable Dissectors\n\nprotocol modbus --enable\nprotocol dnp3 --enable\nprotocol iec61850 --disable\n\n### Dissector-Specific Options\n\nprotocol modbus --port 502 --mode passive\nprotocol dnp3 --port 20000 --auth-key <hex-key>\n\n## Physical Constraint Maps\n\n### Load Constraint Map\n\nconstraint map --load /path/to/map.yaml\nconstraint map --validate\nconstraint map --activate\n\n### Constraint Map Format\n\nversion: 1\ndevice: turbine-governor-x100\nconstraints:\n  - parameter: rotor_speed\n    min: 0\n    max: 3600\n    unit: rpm\n  - parameter: blade_pitch\n    min: -5\n    max: 90\n    unit: degrees\n\n## Alert Configuration\n\n### Thresholds\n\nalert threshold --metric detection_rate --min 0.95 --action log\nalert threshold --metric false_positive_rate --max 0.01 --action alert\n\n### Notification Channels\n\nalert channel --type email --server smtp.example.com --to ops@example.com\nalert channel --type webhook --url https://hooks.example.com/alert\nalert channel --type snmp --community public --target 10.0.0.3\n\n## User Management\n\n### Create User\n\nuser create --username analyst --role operator --password\nuser create --username admin2 --role admin --password\n\n### Role Permissions\n\n- **admin:** Full system access\n- **operator:** View and acknowledge alerts\n- **analyst:** View-only access to evidence and reports\n- **auditor:** Read-only access to logs and audit trails",
