        category: "billing",
        content: "Aryorithm offers node-based licensing with no per-gigabyte or per-event metering.\n\n## Licensing Model\n\n### Node-Based Licensing\n\nEach Blackbox Sentinel appliance requires a license. The license covers:\n\n- All 26 subsystems\n- All 30 protocol dissectors\n- xInfer Engine with all 15 silicon backends\n- Sentinel Nexus fleet management (if applicable)\n- OTA updates and security patches\n- Technical support\n\n### License Tiers\n\n- **Standard:** EUR 45,000/node, business hours support, all features\n- **Professional:** EUR 65,000/node, 24/7 support, all features + dedicated TAM\n- **Enterprise:** Custom pricing, 24/7 + field engineer, all features + custom development\n\n### What Is Included\n\n- **Hardware:** Appliance with 5-year warranty\n- **Software:** All firmware and model updates\n- **Support:** Based on selected tier\n- **Training:** Operator and administrator certification\n- **Documentation:** Full access to all guides\n\n### What Is Not Included\n\n- **Installation:** Available as professional service\n- **Custom dissectors:** Available as professional service\n- **Integration development:** Available as professional service\n\n## Payment Terms\n\n- **Net 30:** Standard payment terms\n- **Annual billing:** 5% discount for annual prepayment\n- **Multi-year:** Custom pricing for 3+ year commitments\n\n## Renewal\n\nLicenses are annual. Renewal notices are sent 90 days before expiration. Unlicensed appliances continue to operate but do not receive updates or support.",
