        content: "Manage your Aryorithm account through the Customer Enclave Portal.\n\n## Accessing the Portal\n\n1. Navigate to https://portal.aryorithm.com\n2. Log in with your credentials\n3. Complete multi-factor authentication\n\n## Account Dashboard\n\nThe dashboard provides:\n\n- **License Status:** Active, expiring, or expired\n- **Appliance Inventory:** All registered appliances\n- **Support Tickets:** Open and resolved tickets\n- **Billing History:** Invoices and payments\n- **Downloads:** Firmware, models, and documentation\n\n## Managing Licenses\n\n### View Licenses\n\nNavigate to Licenses > Overview to see:\n\n- License tier and expiration date\n- Number of licensed appliances\n- Support level and contact information\n\n### Renew License\n\n1. Navigate to Licenses > Renew\n2. Select the license to renew\n3. Choose the renewal term (1, 2, or 3 years)\n4. Review and confirm the order\n5. Submit payment\n\n### Transfer License\n\nLicenses can be transferred between appliances:\n\n1. Navigate to Licenses > Transfer\n2. Select the source appliance\n3. Select the target appliance\n4. Confirm the transfer\n\n## Managing Appliances\n\n### Register Appliance\n\n1. Navigate to Appliances > Register\n2. Enter the appliance serial number\n3. Enter the enrollment token (from the appliance)\n4. Verify the appliance appears in the inventory\n\n### Decommission Appliance\n\n1. Navigate to Appliances > Decommission\n2. Select the appliance to decommission\n3. Confirm the decommission\n4. The license is released for transfer\n\n## Support Tickets\n\n### Create Ticket\n\n1. Navigate to Support > New Ticket\n2. Select the category (Technical, Billing, Security)\n3. Describe the issue\n4. Attach diagnostic bundle if applicable\n5. Submit the ticket\n\n### View Tickets\n\nNavigate to Support > Tickets to see:\n\n- Open tickets and their status\n- Resolved tickets and their resolution\n- Ticket comments and attachments\n\n## Billing\n\n### View Invoices\n\nNavigate to Billing > Invoices to see:\n\n- Invoice number and date\n- Amount and status (paid, pending, overdue)\n- Download PDF invoice\n\n### Update Payment Method\n\n1. Navigate to Billing > Payment Methods\n2. Add or update credit card information\n3. Set the default payment method\n\n### View Payment History\n\nNavigate to Billing > History to see:\n\n- All payments and their status\n- Payment method used\n- Invoice reference",
